   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Bermuda Highway (Jim James solo)** (1 other source): Jim James closed the set with Bermuda Highway, which the taper found awesome [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-03-19.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 8 songs; 46 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Crowd was very enthusiastic, but My Morning Jacket weren't headlining and played roughly an hour; Two-Tone had guitar trouble [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-03-19.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Taped by Low Dog and passed straight from him on CD-R; transferred via EAC to FLAC level 8 [1]",
